    metaTitle: "Litigator Scrubbed Leads Guide",
    excerpt: "A guide to litigator scrubbing, which screens leads against known serial TCPA plaintiffs before outreach.",
    metaDescription: "A guide to litigator scrubbing, the screening process checking leads against known serial TCPA plaintiffs before outreach, protecting buyers from lawsuits.",
